Nex-N2-mini — Turbo Phase Twin — NOTICE & Attributions
======================================================

Turbo Phase Twin packages, quantizes, optimizes, and serves the Nex-N2-mini
language model on Intel Arc (A770 / Arc Pro B70, SYCL). It is an UNOFFICIAL,
community project and is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by
Nex-AGI, the Qwen Team or Alibaba, Intel Corporation, the llama.cpp / ggml
